We have a winner.

1517
00:52:12,700 --> 00:52:13,800
That's right.

1518
00:52:14,900 --> 00:52:16,867
SERVO: Oh, you want me
to sign your yearbook?

1519
00:52:16,900 --> 00:52:18,667
Look, all I know is now, I'm...

1520
00:52:18,700 --> 00:52:20,033
