1521
00:52:20,067 --> 00:52:22,233
My father is gonna kill me,
he really will,

1522
00:52:22,267 --> 00:52:23,433
and I'm not
gonna graduate and...

1523
00:52:23,467 --> 00:52:25,167
MIKE: Because I'll be dead
because he killed me.

1524
00:52:25,200 --> 00:52:28,533
I guess things just don't
wanna work out for me.

1525
00:52:28,567 --> 00:52:29,733
Betty.

1526
00:52:29,767 --> 00:52:31,633
SERVO: Can I still
call you Betty, Betty?

1527
00:52:32,767 --> 00:52:34,433
Betty, you said
that you wanted to come back

1528
