So if I could get
those things for you...

1532
00:52:43,867 --> 00:52:46,400
MIKE: Oh, sorry. A little
bratwurst repeating on me.

1533
00:52:46,433 --> 00:52:49,400
And the way you feel,
I mean, about the whole world.

1534
00:52:49,433 --> 00:52:51,700
Thanks, Marv, but it won't help.

1535
00:52:52,867 --> 00:52:54,033
