Mm-hmm. Suspense. I can't wait.

1554
00:53:40,467 --> 00:53:42,367
It's gonna be so cool
when they reveal it.

1555
00:53:42,400 --> 00:53:44,300
I just can't-- oh.

1556
00:53:45,633 --> 00:53:49,767
MIKE: Dad's new girlfriend
is named Smirnoff.

1557
00:53:49,800 --> 00:53:53,533
SERVO: Why, no one can spend
three bucks the way dad does.

1558
00:53:53,567 --> 00:53:55,567
CROW: This is so beautiful.

1559
00:53:57,667 --> 00:54:00,133
MIKE: Boy, it's like
a Norman Rockwell painting.

1560
00:54:04,467 --> 00:54:06,900
SERVO: You didn't leave
any for me, you jerk.

1561
00:54:08,533 --> 00:54:10,733
