You said you were through.

1562
00:54:10,767 --> 00:54:12,700
MIKE:
Well, it's empty, isn't it?

1563
00:54:12,733 --> 00:54:14,033
Gonna lecture me again?

1564
00:54:14,067 --> 00:54:16,067
CROW: You're grounded.

1565
00:54:18,367 --> 00:54:20,633
SERVO: Might as well have
Mitchell for a dad.

1566
00:54:23,767 --> 00:54:26,300
CROW: Well, Happy Easter anyway.

1567
00:54:26,333 --> 00:54:29,667
MIKE: The Big Brother program
doesn't work for everybody.

1568
00:54:29,700 --> 00:54:31,033
What happened, pop?

1569
00:54:31,067 --> 00:54:33,233
SERVO: I opened the bottle
and drank some.

1570
00:54:33,267 --> 00:54:34,600
She turned me down.

1571
00:54:34,633 --> 00:54:36,100
-SERVO: Why?
-MIKE: Why?

1572
00:54:36,133 --> 00:54:38,200
I ain't good enough for her--

1573
00:54:39,333 --> 00:54:40,700
